AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0001141 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. The Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study is the same cohort as the Sikh Diabetes Study, which its investigators write as AIDHS/SDS ('the AIDHS (also named the SDS)', PMID:23300278); it was minted twice, once from each of the catalog tags AIDHS and SDS. COHO:0001116 (Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study) replaces it and carries all its names.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0001141 "obsolete Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0001141 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

