# Individual: coho:COHO_0001633 (obsolete Cancer Research UK - Cambridge Research Institute)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0001633 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. CRUK-CRI is the PGS Catalog's label for Cancer Research UK's Cambridge Research Institute (Li Ka Shing Centre), an author affiliation in PMID:29892050, placed among the GWAS datasets of PGS000751's variant source. By elimination it most likely stands for the 'UK stage 1 and 2' GWAS of that meta-analysis (the only sub-cohort the Catalog's list lacks), but no text says so; either way it is an institution, not a named study sample. The UK stage 1 and 2 GWAS are genotyping stages of the UK prostate cancer GWAS rather than a cohort. No COHO term or review row uses the name. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0001633 "obsolete Cancer Research UK - Cambridge Research Institute"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0001633 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

