AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002113 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Nashville Biosciences (NashBio), the PGS Catalog cohort id used for scores of Haydarlou et al. 2026 and Kerrebijn et al. 2026, is a company, a data and analytics provider owned by Vanderbilt University Medical Center, and the samples it contributed are BioVU’s (PMC13472937: The NashBio dataset included in this study is a subset of BioVU). Replaced by COHO:0000417, BioVU, which carries the names Nashville Biosciences and NashBio. Found by the review of 2026-09-24."@en)
