# Individual: coho:COHO_0002254 (obsolete Pirkanmaa Hospital District)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002254 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Pirkanmaa Hospital District (PHD) is the Finnish health-care district around Tampere, not a study. The PGS Catalog id is its label for 2283 clinically diagnosed prostate cancer cases from the district's hospital (Tampere University Hospital) in PMID:33051487 (E895.4, Table 1 'Clinical cases (Pirkanmaa Hospital)'), used with FinRSPC cases and controls in a PRS evaluation; the paper gives the case series no study name or recruitment design of its own. The FinRSPC part is a separate id. Other papers found by the name use the district only as a place. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002254 "obsolete Pirkanmaa Hospital District"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002254 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

