# Individual: coho:COHO_0002414 (obsolete Stollery Children’s Hospital Coeliac Clinic)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002414 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. STOLLERY_CC is the PGS Catalog's id for the pilot clinical sample of PMID:32790217: about 128 children referred to the coeliac clinic of the Stollery Children's Hospital (Edmonton, Alberta, Canada) with suspected coeliac disease, plus paediatric gastroenterology controls, used once to evaluate a coeliac genetic risk score (PSS000381). The paper and the Catalog describe it only as a 'pilot clinical cohort' at a tertiary paediatric clinic; it has no study name, design or recruitment beyond that one paper, so it is a clinic's patient sample, not a cohort. No COHO term matches. Recommend obsoleting placeholder COHO:0002414. If the curator prefers to keep one-paper clinical samples, reading the closed full text would be needed for recruitment dates. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002414 "obsolete Stollery Children’s Hospital Coeliac Clinic"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002414 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

