# Individual: coho:COHO_0002475 (obsolete University of Bergen Norway Study)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002475 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. UBNS ('University of Bergen Norway Study') is the PGS Catalog's id for OCAC's contributing study NOR: ovarian cancer cases and controls recruited in Norway in 2001–2010 at Haukeland University Hospital, Bergen. OCAC papers name it only by its institutions: 'The University of Bergen, Haukeland University Hospital, Norway study (NOR)' (PMID:29029385, PMC5630285, funding statement). No design paper or name of its own was found (Europe PMC and web searches for an OCAC NOR study description; the OCAC website did not respond). Like HZ and Poland, it is a site sample labelled by institution, so it is not a cohort. No COHO term matches (coho_names.tsv searched for Bergen, Haukeland and Norw*; the Hordaland Health Study COHO:0001351 and GenKOLS COHO:0001009 are other Bergen samples and unrelated). Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002475 "obsolete University of Bergen Norway Study"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002475 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

