# Individual: coho:COHO_0002539 (obsolete Van Andel Research Institute)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002539 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. VARI is the PGS Catalog's id for a case series in the renal cell carcinoma GWAS of PMID:28598434. It holds about 1,050 kidney cancer patients treated at Spectrum Health Hospital in Grand Rapids, Michigan, and at hospitals of the Cooperative Human Tissue Network, with germline DNA extracted from normal kidney tissue next to the tumour. The supplement calls it only a 'Van Andel Research Institute Case series' (E1193.7), with no study name, recruitment period or design beyond that. Not a cohort. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002539 "obsolete Van Andel Research Institute"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002539 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

