# Individual: coho:COHO_0002582 (obsolete The Washington State University Lung Cancer Study)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 coho:COHO_0002582 coho:COHO_0002434)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002582 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. same cohort as review name E1086. WSULC is the PGS Catalog's id for the study the OncoArray lung cancer paper (PMID:28604730) describes under the heading 'The Washington State University Lung Cancer Study' and lists in its study table as the 'Tampa Lung Cancer Study' (acronym Tampa, institution WSU, PI P. Lazarus, hospital case-control 1999-2003): a Moffitt Cancer Center (Tampa, Florida) case-control study run by an investigator now at Washington State University. That study is the placeholder TampaLC (E1086, COHO:0002434, 'Tampa Lung Cancer Study'), so WSULC is the same sample. When E1086 is curated, 'The Washington State University Lung Cancer Study' should be added as a synonym and WSULC as an acronym. Not the Total Lung Cancer Study (TLC, E-row COHO:0002458), which is a separate Moffitt study described next to it. Replaced by COHO:0002434 (Tampa Lung Cancer Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002582 "obsolete The Washington State University Lung Cancer Study"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002582 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

